          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 2,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Mary leaves home and travels on a bearing of ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "125^\\circ",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " to a cafe 3 km away from her home.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p43-q7-stem-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 2,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "From there she travels to a shopping mall that has bearing ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "200^\\circ",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " and 5 km from her home.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p43-q7-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find the distance of the shopping mall from the cafe, correct to one decimal place.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$5.1\\text{ km}$.",
          "worked": "Let $H$, $C$ and $M$ denote home, the cafe and the mall. In a bearings sketch, the included angle at home is $\\angle CHM=200^\\circ-125^\\circ=75^\\circ$. Let $CM=d$ km.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}d^2&=3^2+5^2-2(3)(5)\\cos75^\\circ\\\\d^2&=34-30\\cos75^\\circ\\\\d&=\\sqrt{34-30\\cos75^\\circ}\\\\d&\\approx5.122053167\\\\d&\\approx5.1\\text{ km}\\quad\\text{(1 d.p.)}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 80
      },
      {
        "id": "p43-q7-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Find the bearing of the shopping mall from the cafe, correct to the nearest degree.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p43-q7-b-short-result",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "234^\\circ",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ".",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "p43-q7-b-short-method",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Use the cosine rule to find the angle at the cafe, then subtract it from ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "305^\\circ",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ".",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "Let $\\alpha=\\angle HCM$ and retain the exact distance $d=\\sqrt{34-30\\cos75^\\circ}$ from part (a).\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos\\alpha&=\\frac{3^2+d^2-5^2}{2(3)d}\\\\\\alpha&=\\cos^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{3^2+d^2-5^2}{6d}\\right)\\\\\\alpha&\\approx70.545938073^\\circ\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe bearing of home from the cafe is $125^\\circ+180^\\circ=305^\\circ$. The mall lies anticlockwise from this direction. Let its bearing from the cafe be $b$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}b&=305^\\circ-\\alpha\\\\b&\\approx234.454061927^\\circ\\\\b&\\approx234^\\circ\\quad\\text{(nearest degree)}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 56
      }
    ]
  },
